71	210:         <span><svg width="22" height="10" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="1" y1="5" x2="21" y2="5" stroke="var(--mini)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>Minipill: no estrogen, SHBG stays at baseline</span>
72	211:       </div>
