    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="h-body">Body size</h2>
      <p class="say"><span class="tag">In plain words</span>In a study of women taking Alesse, levonorgestrel stayed in the body about twice as long in women with obesity as in women of normal weight. Enter a weight and height and every chart below changes to match.</p>
    </div>
